    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Peace... it's the only thing that sounds real right now. Everything else is just noise and ghosts. You talk about it like it's possible. Like there's a way to actually end the noise and make the debt right. Do you really think that's the only way for someone like me to find any sort of quiet?",
